{"id":"dmwbblr6ao5d4","name":"滑动删除","tags":["交互","拖拽","动画"],"aliases":[],"summary":"消息列表行向左拖动时整行跟手位移，右后露出红色「删除」按钮；松手越过半程吸附到全开位，不足则用阻尼缓动弹回；向右反向拖回可取消。行尾「⋯」提供不靠拖动的等价入口。","usage":"消息、邮件、任务这类行式列表的单项删除，每行操作一到两个；移动端优先，桌面端必须同时给行尾按钮。","caution":"删除不可恢复时别直接滑删；行内操作超过两个改用「⋯」菜单。需要多选批量的列表不要用滑删。","hint":"按住一行向左拖，过半松手吸附；向右拖回可取消。","inspiration":"","prompt":"【滑动删除】目标：列表行向左拖动时整行跟手位移，露出行尾删除按钮；松手按距离吸附或回弹，反向拖回可取消。\n\n1) 结构：panel > 标题行 + list > row。row 是 position:relative、overflow:hidden、圆角 10px；row 内先放 .acts（absolute inset:0、justify-content:flex-end，内含 88px 宽的 .del，底色 danger），再放 .face（relative、高 38px、圆角 10px、不透明底色，盖住 acts）。face 内是 20px 头像块 + 11px/600 标题 + 9px 次要色副标题 + 行尾 22px「⋯」按钮。\n\n2) 跟手：pointerdown 记 startX 和当前位移（读 getComputedStyle 的 matrix 第 5 项），先量 mid → cancel 旧动画 → 把 mid 写回内联 transform，保证不跳。pointermove 里 x = clientX - (startX - 已打开位移)，每帧直接写 face.style.transform = translateX(x)，绝不写 transition。越界阻尼：x < -88 用 -88 + (x+88)*0.28，x > 0 用 x*0.30。face 设 touch-action:pan-y、user-select:none、will-change:transform。\n\n3) 松手判定：x < -44 吸附全开 -88，否则回 0；再加甩动：vx < -0.5px/ms 且 x < -16 直接开，vx > 0.5 且 x > -72 直接关。收尾用 el.animate([{translateX(from)},{translateX(to)}], 280–330ms, cubic-bezier(.22,.82,.24,1), fill:both)，onfinish 再写一次内联值并 cancel，避免 fill 残留。\n\n4) 取消/反向/快速重复：pointercancel 一律回 0（300ms）。已打开时再按住，从 -88 继续算，向右拖回不足半程即收回。快速连拖时 pointerdown 里 cancel 旧动画并从当前矩阵值接管；旧动画的 onfinish 用 if(s.anim===a) 判等丢弃，防止覆盖新状态。同一属性同一时刻只由「拖动」或「收尾动画」其中一个写。\n\n5) 非拖动入口：行尾「⋯」点击 = 展开/收起（等价把行推到 -88 或拉回 0），aria-expanded 同步；.del 默认 tabindex=-1，行打开后变 0，键盘可 Tab 到删除。删除后行高收起到 0（240ms）再 display:none，计数更新，role=status 播报「已删除 1 条」。\n\n6) 无障碍：prefers-reduced-motion 下跳过收尾动画直接落位；aria-label 写清「删除这条消息」；不要用 scrollIntoView。\n\n7) 配色：只用 --ui-*。行底 color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-text) 5%, var(--ui-surface))，边框 color-mix(text 13%)，danger 按钮文字用 var(--ui-bg)。\n\n8) 坑：face 底色必须不透明，否则透出下面的红色；row 的 overflow:hidden 负责裁掉滑出的内容；不要给 .face 写 transition:transform；pointerdown 要跳过 button 目标，否则「⋯」点不动。\n\n9) 自动演示：包在 !window.__uiInteractive 里，用 window.__uiDemoCursor()：at 到行左侧 16px → 等 0.56 秒 press → 每帧 tween 到 -114 并同时 cursor.at 跟随（拖动期间给 cursor.el 加 .sweeping 禁用其位移过渡）→ release → 吸附 -88 → 再按住已打开的行向右拖 74px 松手取消 → hide，约 1.1 秒后循环。首轮延迟 0.32 秒，读 rect 后宽高为 0 就重试。","demoHtml":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>滑动删除</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 14px;\n    background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);overflow:hidden;\n    font:13px/1.35 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}\n  .panel{width:100%;max-width:330px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n  .hd{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 3px 6px}\n  .hd b{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.01em}\n  .hd span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .list{flex:1 1 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n  .row{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:5px;\n    background:var(--ui-danger);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 92%,var(--ui-bg))}\n  .row:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\n  .acts{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:stretch;justify-content:flex-end}\n  .del{width:88px;height:100%;margin:0;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;\n    color:var(--ui-bg);font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n  .del:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 14%,transparent)}\n  .del:active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 24%,transparent)}\n  .del:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-bg);outline-offset:-7px;border-radius:9px}\n  .face{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:38px;padding:0 3px 0 9px;\n    border-radius:10px;cursor:grab;will-change:transform;touch-action:pan-y;\n    -webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;\n    background:var(--ui-surface);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 5%,var(--ui-surface));\n    border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n    border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 13%,transparent)}\n  .face:active{cursor:grabbing}\n  .row.dragging .face{box-shadow:0 5px 14px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 16%,transparent)}\n  .av{flex:0 0 auto;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    font-size:9px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:var(--ui-brand);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 16%,transparent);\n    border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 26%,transparent)}\n  .meta{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0}\n  .meta b{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;\n    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n  .meta i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:9px;line-height:1.3;margin-top:1px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .more{flex:0 0 auto;width:22px;height:22px;margin:0;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:7px;\n    background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:13px;line-height:1;\n    cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    opacity:.55;transform:none;\n    transition:opacity .18s ease,background .18s ease}\n  .row:hover .more,.row.open .more,.more:focus-visible{opacity:1}\n  .more:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 9%,transparent)}\n  .more:active{transform:scale(.9)}\n  .sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n  .demo-cursor.sweeping{transition:none}\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:9px 12px}\n    .hd{padding-bottom:4px}\n    .row{margin-bottom:4px}\n    .face{height:35px}\n    .meta b{font-size:10.5px}\n    .meta i{font-size:8.5px}\n    .av{width:18px;height:18px;font-size:8px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <div class=\"hd\"><b>收件箱</b><span id=\"count\">3 条消息</span></div>\n  <div class=\"list\" id=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"row\" data-id=\"1\">\n      <div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"删除这条消息\">删除</button></div>\n      <div class=\"face\" data-face>\n        <span class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">设</span>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>设计评审移到周四 14:00</b><i>10:24 · 项目群</i></div>\n        <button class=\"more\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开这行的删除按钮\" aria-expanded=\"false\">⋯</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\" data-id=\"2\">\n      <div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"删除这条消息\">删除</button></div>\n      <div class=\"face\" data-face>\n        <span class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">账</span>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>本月账单已生成</b><i>昨天 · 财务</i></div>\n        <button class=\"more\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开这行的删除按钮\" aria-expanded=\"false\">⋯</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\" data-id=\"3\">\n      <div class=\"acts\"><button class=\"del\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"删除这条消息\">删除</button></div>\n      <div class=\"face\" data-face>\n        <span class=\"av\" aria-hidden=\"true\">接</span>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>接口文档更新了 3 处</b><i>周一 · 研发</i></div>\n        <button class=\"more\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开这行的删除按钮\" aria-expanded=\"false\">⋯</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sr\" id=\"live\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  \"use strict\";\n  var OPEN = 88, HALF = 44;\n  var rows = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\".row\"));\n  var live = document.getElementById(\"live\");\n  var countEl = document.getElementById(\"count\");\n  var count = rows.length;\n  var states = [];\n  var cursor = null, demoTimer = null;\n  var reduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n\n  function resist(raw){\n    if (raw < 0) return raw >= -OPEN ? raw : -OPEN + (raw + OPEN) * 0.28;\n    return raw * 0.30;\n  }\n  function currentX(face){\n    var t = getComputedStyle(face).transform;\n    if (!t || t === \"none\") return 0;\n    var m = t.match(/matrix\\(([^)]+)\\)/);\n    return m ? parseFloat(m[1].split(\",\")[4]) : 0;\n  }\n  function sync(s){\n    s.row.classList.toggle(\"open\", s.open);\n    s.del.tabIndex = s.open ? 0 : -1;\n    s.more.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", s.open ? \"true\" : \"false\");\n  }\n  function settle(s, from, to, dur){\n    if (s.anim){ try{ s.anim.cancel(); }catch(e){} s.anim = null; }\n    s.x = to; s.open = to !== 0; sync(s);\n    if (reduced || Math.abs(to - from) < 0.6){\n      s.face.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + to + \"px)\";\n      return;\n    }\n    var a = s.face.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + from + \"px)\"},\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + to + \"px)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur, easing:\"cubic-bezier(.22,.82,.24,1)\", fill:\"both\"});\n    s.anim = a;\n    a.onfinish = function(){\n      s.face.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + to + \"px)\";\n      try{ a.cancel(); }catch(e){}\n      if (s.anim === a) s.anim = null;\n    };\n  }\n  function removeRow(s){\n    if (s.removed) return;\n    s.removed = true;\n    s.del.disabled = true;\n    count = Math.max(0, count - 1);\n    countEl.textContent = count > 0 ? count + \" 条消息\" : \"已清空\";\n    live.textContent = \"已删除 1 条消息\";\n    var h = s.row.getBoundingClientRect().height;\n    if (reduced){ s.row.style.display = \"none\"; return; }\n    var a = s.row.animate([\n      {height: h + \"px\", marginBottom: \"5px\", opacity: 1},\n      {height: \"0px\", marginBottom: \"0px\", opacity: 0}\n    ], {duration: 240, easing: \"cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)\", fill: \"both\"});\n    a.onfinish = function(){ s.row.style.display = \"none\"; };\n  }\n  function wire(s){\n    var face = s.face, drag = false, base = 0, pid = null, vx = 0, lastX = 0, lastT = 0;\n\n    face.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function(e){\n      if (e.pointerType === \"mouse\" && e.button !== 0) return;\n      if (e.target.closest && e.target.closest(\"button\")) return;\n      if (s.removed) return;\n      /* 中断接管：先量当前实际位移，再停掉旧动画，避免跳回动画起点 */\n      var mid = currentX(face);\n      if (s.anim){ try{ s.anim.cancel(); }catch(err){} s.anim = null; }\n      face.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + mid + \"px)\";\n      drag = true; pid = e.pointerId;\n      s.x = mid;\n      base = e.clientX - s.x;\n      lastX = e.clientX; lastT = performance.now(); vx = 0;\n      try{ face.setPointerCapture(pid); }catch(err){}\n      s.row.classList.add(\"dragging\");\n    });\n\n    face.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", function(e){\n      if (!drag) return;\n      e.preventDefault();\n      var now = performance.now(), dt = now - lastT;\n      if (dt > 0){\n        var inst = (e.clientX - lastX) / dt;\n        vx = vx * 0.62 + inst * 0.38;\n        lastX = e.clientX; lastT = now;\n      }\n      /* 跟手：每帧直接写 transform，这里不经过任何过渡 */\n      face.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + resist(e.clientX - base).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n    });\n\n    function end(){\n      if (!drag) return;\n      drag = false;\n      s.row.classList.remove(\"dragging\");\n      if (pid !== null){ try{ face.releasePointerCapture(pid); }catch(err){} pid = null; }\n      var x = currentX(face), target = 0;\n      if (x < -HALF) target = -OPEN;\n      else if (vx < -0.5 && x < -16) target = -OPEN;\n      else if (vx > 0.5 && x > -OPEN + 16) target = 0;\n      settle(s, x, target, target === 0 ? 330 : 280);\n      vx = 0;\n    }\n    face.addEventListener(\"pointerup\", end);\n    face.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\", function(){\n      if (!drag) return;\n      drag = false;\n      s.row.classList.remove(\"dragging\");\n      if (pid !== null){ try{ face.releasePointerCapture(pid); }catch(err){} pid = null; }\n      settle(s, currentX(face), 0, 300);\n    });\n\n    s.more.addEventListener(\"click\", function(){\n      settle(s, currentX(face), s.open ? 0 : -OPEN, 320);\n    });\n    s.del.addEventListener(\"click\", function(){ removeRow(s); });\n  }\n\n  rows.forEach(function(row){\n    var s = {\n      row: row,\n      face: row.querySelector(\"[data-face]\"),\n      del: row.querySelector(\".del\"),\n      more: row.querySelector(\".more\"),\n      x: 0, open: false, anim: null, removed: false\n    };\n    states.push(s);\n    sync(s);\n    wire(s);\n  });\n\n  function tween(dur, from, to, onStep, done){\n    if (reduced){ onStep(to); if (done) done(); return; }\n    var t0 = performance.now();\n    function frame(t){\n      var p = Math.min(1, (t - t0) / dur);\n      var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 2.4);\n      onStep(from + (to - from) * e);\n      if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n      else if (done) done();\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  }\n\n  function startDemo(){\n    var s = states[0];\n    if (!s || s.removed) return;\n    if (typeof window.__uiDemoCursor !== \"function\") return;\n    var face = s.face;\n    var r = face.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if (!r.width || !r.height){ demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 400); return; }\n    if (!cursor) cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    if (!cursor || !cursor.el) return;\n    var cy = r.top + r.height / 2;\n    var head = r.left + 16;\n    var baseX = head - OPEN + 30;\n\n    function show(){ cursor.el.classList.add(\"show\"); }\n\n    show();\n    cursor.at(head, cy);\n    demoTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n      /* 第一段：向左拖出，手指拉过全开位，行被阻尼咬住 */\n      tween(560, 0, -114, function(raw){\n        face.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + resist(raw).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n        cursor.at(head + raw, cy);\n      }, function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        settle(s, currentX(face), -OPEN, 300);\n        demoTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n          /* 第二段：再次按住已打开的行，向右拖回取消 */\n          cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n          cursor.at(baseX, cy);\n          demoTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n            cursor.press();\n            cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n            tween(520, 0, 74, function(raw){\n              face.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + resist(-OPEN + raw).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n              cursor.at(baseX + raw, cy);\n            }, function(){\n              cursor.release();\n              settle(s, currentX(face), 0, 340);\n              demoTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n                cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n                cursor.hide();\n                if (s.open) settle(s, currentX(face), 0, 300);\n                demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 1150);\n              }, 720);\n            });\n          }, 500);\n        }, 620);\n      });\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  if (!window.__uiInteractive){\n    demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 320);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","createdAt":1794353263570,"updatedAt":"2026-11-10T23:28:22.066Z"}